    "updated_at": "2016-09-13T19:29:18Z",
    "body": "Two complications: 1) Serialize does not mean persist to IDB, e.g., SharedArrayBuffer. 2) Serialize and Deserialize happen in different tasks and can each fail. We currently do not handle failure for the latter.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
